#: classes/components/AcfFieldGroupComponent.php:102
msgid "Preset"
msgstr "Preset"

#: classes/components/AcfFieldGroupComponent.php:105
msgid "Choose one of the available mega menu presets."
msgstr "Kies een van de beschikbare mega menu presets."

#: classes/components/AcfFieldGroupComponent.php:126
